From 826b227cef3c39873ac114deeda30c0d511106e5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Davide Palma (ElDavo)" <github@davidepalma.it>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 10:57:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] install: also protect the boot partition during zip installs

Generalize the recovery write guard to PartitionWriteGuard and use it for
/boot too (kernel / KernelSU boot image). New setting tw_protect_boot,
default off, shown where the boot partition exists.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Wa3ghNiH9YWmrNGXcPt1iR
